{
 "about": "How scripts/run.py reaches each chat's API. key_env names the environment variable (or .env entry) holding the key; keys are never stored here. Model ids are what we ask for; run.json records what the API reports back. Model ids marked toConfirm are a best guess and must be checked against the provider's model list before a run. Open models can run through OpenRouter, Hugging Face Inference Providers, or locally (Ollama, llama.cpp) with an OpenAI-compatible base_url.",
 "providers": {
  "deepseek": {
   "api": "openai",
   "base_url": "https://api.deepseek.com",
